title: Organisations of PPS
subtitle: One investment in one action: the press, TUR or a cooperative.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_organizations.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.organizationsAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.organizations (technical reference 13.5; card catalogue 5.1). Z — 0.78 (decision 2A of 8 X 2026): one investment
// in one action, chosen on one page — the press, TUR or a cooperative; Milicja has its own card (polish_party_militia) and the
// unions theirs (polish_party_union_investments). The choice is carried out at once for its R and this month's action.
PolishParty.organizationsView(Q);
!}

= Organisations of PPS

PPS has [+ pl_org_cash +] R. Choose one investment; it is carried out at once. Milicja has its own card.

- @press_distribution
- @tur
- @cooperative_workers
- @cooperative_rural
- @easy_discard

@press_distribution
title: Extend the distribution of the press
subtitle: 1 resource; the press reaches more readers (+10).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['press_distribution']).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_press_distribution_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['press_distribution']);
!}
go-to: result

@tur
title: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : Found TUR ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : Start the next stage of TUR ?]
subtitle: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR starts its work and gains cadres (+10). ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR rises one level and gains cadres (+10). ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['tur']).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_tur_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['tur']);
!}
go-to: result

@cooperative_workers
title: Prepare a workers’ consumer cooperative
subtitle: 1 resource; its launch waits in the party agenda (2 resources).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['cooperative_workers']).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_cooperative_workers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['cooperative_workers']);
!}
go-to: result

@cooperative_rural
title: Prepare a village cooperative of smallholders
subtitle: 1 resource; its launch waits in the party agenda (2 resources).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['cooperative_rural']).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_cooperative_rural_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['cooperative_rural']);
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

